<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Long my heart has sighed for Thee;</l><l>Long has evil dwelt within;</l><l>Jesus sweetly speaks to me,</l><l>“I will cleanse you from all sin.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here I give my all to Thee—</l><l>Friends and time and earthly store,</l><l>Soul and body Thine to be—</l><l>Wholly Thine forevermore.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In the promises I trust;</l><l>Now I feel the blood applied;</l><l>I am prostrate in the dust;</l><l>I with Christ am crucified.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
